[gd_resource type="Environment" load_steps=3 format=3]

; Money Quest World's shared atmosphere, used by Main.tscn's WorldEnvironment
; for every zone that doesn't provide its own EnvironmentOverride: a soft
; stylised daytime sky, warm sky-tinted ambient light (so shaded sides stay
; readable, never dark), linear tone mapping (keeps the palette's colours
; true instead of washing them out) and a light depth fog
; that fades distant hills and mountains into the horizon colour. Only
; features the GL Compatibility renderer supports — no SSAO, SSR, SDFGI,
; glow or volumetric fog.

